<title>UK: REUTERS 9TH EX-UK/AMERICAS AIR CARGO REPORT.</title>
<headline>REUTERS 9TH EX-UK/AMERICAS AIR CARGO REPORT.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Aug 7 (Reuter) Below are the current average ex-UK air cargo rates to the United States and Latin America per kg for a 100 kg shipment,with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>			Aug 1	     July 3</p>
<p>			 UNITED STATES</p>
<p>     LON-CHI	0.68		 0.68</p>
<p>     LON-JFK	0.60		 0.60</p>
<p>     LON-LAX	0.75		 0.75</p>
<p>     LON-MIA	0.55		 0.60</p>
<p>     LON-HOU	0.77		 0.80</p>
<p>			 LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p>     LON-SAO	1.85		 1.85</p>
<p>     LON-BUE	2.05		 1.90</p>
<p>     LON-SCL	1.95		 1.90</p>
<p>     LON-CCS	1.25		 1.28</p>
<p>     LON-BOG	1.30		 1.30</p>
<p>     LON-MEX	1.28		 1.25</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents at the three main cnfLondon airports.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in sterling.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
